{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794379373,"nonce":"yhUiLA4LSan6Igo3UD+ol/10icM=","title":"The own hash covered 10 of the 88 RenderProps fields, so incremental updates missed or kept stale props","message":"`hash_render_props` (blinc_layout/src/diff.rs) hashed background, radius, border colour and width, layer, material, shadow, transform, opacity and clips_content. Every other field was invisible to change detection: z_index, cursor, outline_*, inner_shadow, filter, clip_path, mix_blend_mode, mask_*, pointer_events_none, the text and svg props, the 3D props, and more.\n\nTwo effects.\n- A change to only such a prop made `incremental_update` return NoChanges, so it was dropped until something else changed.\n- Since the own-hash skip in `update_render_props_in_place` (PR 71, which keeps the props of a node whose own hash is unchanged), a change to such a prop beside an unrelated change, e.g. one node's colour, was dropped as well. Before that skip every node's props were replaced on every update, so those changes were applied by accident.\n\nEvidence: `a_prop_the_hash_missed_is_applied_beside_a_visual_change` (z_index stays 0 where 7 is expected) and `a_prop_the_hash_missed_is_an_update_on_its_own` (NoChanges) both fail on the old hash and pass on the new one.\n\nFix: `hash_render_props` names every field. Adding a field to RenderProps does not compile until it is hashed or listed as left out. Left out: node_id (the tree assigns it), motion (the parent sets it and the update preserves it), tiers and important_colors (what the stylesheet applied). The closure `motion_on_ready_callback` is hashed as present or absent: the tree builder assigns it from the element, `render_props()` never does. svg_tag_styles is summed over its entries because two equal maps iterate in different orders.\n\nA change that only touches a field outside `props_visually_equal` is classified as a layout change, so it costs a relayout. That is safe and rare; widening that comparator is separate.\n\nNot covered here: git-bug for `Div::visible` (visible_source is outside both the hash and layout_style).","files":null}]}